Date: Wed, 12 Aug 2026 09:46:45 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 43/60] Glint: adblock in profile tabs, theme-aware palette,
 Glint profile deletion

- Schibsted CMP blocker moved to a bundled component extension
  (glint_schibsted) so it covers every profile incl. /profile sessions;
  loader generalized for both bundled blockers
- Command palette follows the browser color scheme (Electron dark palette)
- glint://delete-profile/<name>: closes the profile's tabs in all windows
  and schedules the profile directory for deletion (settings > Profiles)
